                                                   rdfs:label "Act of Declarative Communication"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Communication that changes the reality in accord with the proposition of the declaration."@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Examples: Baptism, Sentencing a person to imprisonment, Pronouncing a couple husband and wife, Declaring war"@en ;
